<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>母体映射与衔接</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#C7D6EE' }}>manhua.py 章节切片教学包</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ margin: '26px 40px 0 40px', background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 22px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
      本节课写的 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>build_scene_prompt</span> = 综合案例的 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>构件2·提示词构建</span>。第7章把写死的 name / selling_point 换成从文件读的 SKU，提示词照常调用本课函数——学生立刻看到第4章的零件被复用。
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', padding: '20px 40px', gap: 14 }}>
    {[{ t: '第4章', s: '字符串·构件2' }, { t: '第7章', s: '文件与数据' }, { t: '面向对象', s: 'Product 类' }, { t: '综合', s: 'V1–V5 全管线' }].map((it, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 170, height: 96, background: i === 3 ? '#1E4FA8' : '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 12, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: i === 3 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#0E3F8C' }}>{it.t}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: i === 3 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#4A5568' }}>{it.s}</Text>
        </Box>
        {i < 3 && <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>→</Text>}
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ margin: '0 40px 34px 40px', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
      真实 API 调用 + .env 密钥，全部推到综合阶段（最后一步才出现），切片阶段零环境依赖。
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, right: 0, height: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>09 / 09</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
